description "Canderous Ordo - Mandalore the Preserver

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- RoF: 1.25x
^2-- Lightweight

^3Abilities:
- Overclock ^3[CS1]
- Shoulder Barge (1) ^3[Melee CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Cybernetics (3)
- Brawler Guard
- Rally
^2- Knockback Given: 1.1x
^2- Knockback Taken: .8x
^1- Skill Recharge: .71x


A slow but exceptionally well-armored warrior enhanced by cybernetics, implants, with access to repeater rifles and a vibroblade."
